  "description": "Tae-Hee is the governor's demure daughter during the day and a merciless dominatrix at night. When the lustful ghost king threatens to keep seducing the women in the village unless he's offered a maiden as his bride, Tae-Hee acts as bait to take him down. With the help of a famous exorcist and her own experiences conquering men, she thinks she'll get a good crack at punishing her arrogant husband. But once they're dragged into the world of ghosts, a rocky path lies ahead of them. Will Tae-Hee's determination and spicy expertise be enough to defeat her enemy?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: This work pre-released in English before releasing in Korean.*",
